e-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6419c7d7-b0be-4f8e-a4db-5d2c5bc8ade8\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e74393c0-e37c-4d18-9975-a438b086c3cd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-11a7655d-8fb9-4cd2-97da-d8df9a65326c\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-80c87ce3-b338-475d-bcb7-adc375eebf35\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-95c542d8-2648-4878-8e7d-1a752289cade\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-518a6928-5cb9-4cec-a3b3-e4298479d0f2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-22e3f7a7-cc88-439e-bfb6-b91156f1dfd8\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4bbdee8e-3492-420a-b963-e9c26c392ba4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-88d3efec-5969-4b4e-b0fd-0f2525a92ef6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5d6d10ce-6050-4f34-9651-ac58d5c10e98\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c3d4d05c-633c-44e2-a7ec-3d36b398f481\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-99b45f9b-d9c3-474e-9e86-9d8e5b078909\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-951969c5-8b96-49bc-b202-a4f2cdbb57ea\"><b>📢 2월 20일(목) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-50fe4213-2565-44d5-b25a-914dc8b70421\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-81750536-011e-46a1-982c-5e369e3c0de2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c96f998a-55f7-4983-98f7-474342ddd164\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-324d4f5d-7f6f-4f62-ac3a-0c307da828a8\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d676336a-aa61-425d-b9b7-e709aa6de6a5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-93cab2e6-9dcb-490e-a6b7-e7ccb3da0ad8\">- 2/20(목) 22:30 ~ 2/21(금) 00:30 경​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-52fa17d3-16dc-42ea-b37e-8fe918680fb3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7e1210ac-17a1-4f1d-ad34-8523ce2680b8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eb6cb62e-fe67-4cb9-9f7a-bf6692d4f5d9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5ca88d0e-f706-4ef6-ab39-5ee5b124e811\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-223b1086-f82c-4a67-addc-c01091583b37\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-eb3f7f84-7dd4-4453-b235-d1649221bcc8\">1. 특정 상황의 미니게임 EVANGELION RedSea Scout에서 일부 이미지 또는 글자가 어색하게 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c69e651b-509f-43bc-be77-f548f92b2102\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8431c2a7-2956-4795-88b5-2a2835dc94cf\">2. SECOND QUEST 이벤트 필드에서 일부 오브젝트의 디자인을 조정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b6b46605-496e-4199-bd6f-2de17c04f701\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6f72484c-3193-4d57-bc01-93bf6fdac444\">3. 헬름 코스튬 &#x27;애프터 샤워&#x27;의 표현이 좀 더 자연스럽도록 일부 부위를 조정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0ec52ad0-bc68-411a-bf53-f3ecefe7c5dc\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6ce6f6c6-178f-4ad2-b172-0afb98214f4b\">4. 특정 비율의 화면에서 SECOND QUEST 이벤트 필드 최초 진입 시, 일부 NPC가 어색하게 배치되어 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a3ec6ffc-6734-4b08-9bda-a7695948dae3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b9713fa3-64b3-4ddf-b1fa-93b0b5e7bbbd\">5. 업데이트 후 특정 전투 상황에서 최대 장탄 수가 기존과 다르게 적용되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e8ac507d-f9b9-4b7b-86d6-9ab041eb11f5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-966fb58b-faab-4ea5-97a7-056327e53c4d\">6. 캠페인 35, 36 챕터 필드에서 의도와 다른 BGM이 재생되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0123838f-3b50-4af0-9ca7-ef516a10ee00\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8ea89e19-fbe3-4d17-b0a1-b5ff32d0ab7d\">7. 주크박스에서 특정 BGM의 제목이 잘못 표기되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-de763ddc-142b-4e3b-988e-ebe07aab70ba\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-05c267a4-bda4-4278-89d4-a34c92afc71f\">[기존]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a2902dbd-9fd6-4c83-87ba-7bb93f0c27b9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0c9605f3-dcfd-4e15-b11d-88c39f715233\">└ Leviathan</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a182e87d-746b-46b9-8e6f-16494f69f6f6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1a7a440d-67fc-447b-ae87-d7877f341269\">[변경]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b5a24a63-c88c-4f75-8083-21519468e3a2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3cb0b255-d98c-4db5-b403-927a11fc334b\">└ Dark Eyes</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-df419704-aa26-4616-a3e9-29f046295329\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0abe7f74-848f-4b06-a9df-8de41e71960f\">8. 일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-afe7ad23-00f5-4e52-8713-4d1d2f6043ed\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fc1f3c5b-f3ea-44bb-9f9f-3b2c2936e420\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-29aae4ce-ddef-4881-a6c5-793c3a5db5a0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e3d5101c-8c56-4025-972b-5f65c194258e\">​​​</span><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4c026626-5150-47a3-bec5-17a2bef8e994\">※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 